{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arthur's 2nd Grade is the perfect combination of learning, fun, and helpful features. With 15 different educational activities and 20 creative activities, Arthur's 2nd Grade teaches a full year's worth of second grade skills and entertains your child with limitless fun and learning!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Activity Center</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create storybooks and cards. Or, print puzzles, games and more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Geography</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Muffy plan deliveries for her dad\u2019s nationwide business.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progress Tracking</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete all the learning activities to unlock 3 fun reward activities!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Kids Learn</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reading</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synonyms &amp; Antonyms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compound Words</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arithmetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Measurement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Telling Time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Writing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arts &amp; Crafts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drawing &amp; Coloring</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Geography</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Categorization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patterns &amp; Sequences</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Special Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Skill Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress Reports</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic Help Messages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Printable Activities</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4056570?t=1765237052","background_raw":